  "worked_solution": "To estimate the price of each can of paint, we need to find an approximation for $95.64÷4.$\n\nSo, we round the dividend to the nearest whole number:\n\n$$\n95.64\\to 96\n$$\n\nNow, we divide $96$ by $4$ as usual:\n\n$$\n96÷4=24\n$$\n\nTherefore, the approximate price of each can of paint is $$24.$",
